ng tools are not supported. We will improve the operation of the 3dof handle in subsequent updates.\n\nImportant Update: Support Oculus controller\n\n-Bullet Time: Rotating the handle can make the game screen enter the cool bullet time, the sense of the movie blockbuster.\n-Character Jumping: Tap the touchpad to jump high, and the battle on the roof is completely open!\n-Grenade Throwing: Raise the handle and press the trigger. The grenade can knock down a bunch of enemies.\n-New tutorial: animation guide, operation is no longer lost!\n\nChesstar", "created_date": 1585214227, "id": "2804547742932726", "version": "1.0.6", "version_code": 7, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1172102179510632", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2804547742932726"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1800480756875650"}]}, "change_log": "1.Added \u201cJump\u201d , now you can press button 2 to jump. Using jump to jump up buildings, crates, vehicles and anything you can imagine.\r\n2.Added \u201cBullet time\u201d, now you can initiate/cease bullet time by touching right stick. In bullet time, both you and enemy moves in half speed.\r\n3.Added \u201cRoll\u201d, now you can roll forward/backward/left/right with D-Pad, which enables you to move some distance in a instant.\r\n4.Now you can ride tank/mammoth tank/helicopter and apache, enjoy it!\r\n5.We added 6 level.\r\n6.The games\u2019 camera moving method has been optimized, which will prevent VR sickness.\r\n7.The games\u2019 UI has been optimized to fix judder issue, which will prevent VR sickness.\r\n8.Fixed some bugs 